    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/57414d7f1c65bc2e0ebb42b4ead8caa2.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/57414d7f1c65bc2e0ebb42b4ead8caa2.webp?t=1754583361\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/d3d8e51329954a8ad2e24102ea8d8f71.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/d3d8e51329954a8ad2e24102ea8d8f71.webm?t=1754583361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/d3d8e51329954a8ad2e24102ea8d8f71.mp4?t=1754583361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prison Boss Prohibition traz as artimanhas de cria\u00e7\u00e3o e simula\u00e7\u00e3o do Prison Boss VR para fora da pris\u00e3o e para as ruas!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bem-vindo \u00e0 cidade de New Yolk, um lugar maravilhoso para se viver, exceto pelo fato de o prefeito ter entrado em uma onda de proibi\u00e7\u00f5es. Administre uma cadeia de barracas que fabricam mercadorias legais e de legalidade question\u00e1vel, tudo em uma miss\u00e3o para conquistar o mercado negro e ganhar muita grana!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOGUE SOZINHO OU ARRANJE UM COMPARSA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voc\u00ea pode ser um ovo independente, jogar no modo cooperativo com um de seus amigos... ou recrutar um estranho totalmente confi\u00e1vel na internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/5796e719789d64d2e47d3b57d3377ad3.webp?t=1754583361\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRODUZA SEM SER PEGO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabrique cerveja, enrole cigarros e adapte-se \u00e0 medida que o prefeito muda o rol de proibi\u00e7\u00f5es. Mas tome cuidado: a Pol\u00edcia de New Yolk est\u00e1 intensificando a repress\u00e3o ao contrabando. Se pegarem voc\u00ea ou seu parceiro, v\u00e3o apreender a sua mercadoria, e seu neg\u00f3cio ser\u00e1 depenado!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/307f28ddaf5e3869ddff6653e5c8f998.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/307f28ddaf5e3869ddff6653e5c8f998.webp?t=1754583361\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GANHE DINHEIRO E CONSTRUA SUA REPUTA\u00c7\u00c3O</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venda sua mercadoria para todos, de trabalhadores a rica\u00e7os, para ganhar dinheiro. Aceite trabalhos especiais para aumentar sua reputa\u00e7\u00e3o entre as diferentes fac\u00e7\u00f5es da cidade. Construa sua reputa\u00e7\u00e3o nas ruas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/7eae4a380e56d801e890ae9a571b8a7d.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/7eae4a380e56d801e890ae9a571b8a7d.webp?t=1754583361\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSONALIZE SUAS LOJAS E SEU VISUAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agora que voc\u00ea enriqueceu, \u00e9 hora de ganhar ainda mais! Melhore sua loja e seus equipamentos para aumentar a efici\u00eancia. Melhore sua apar\u00eancia para se tornar o cara mais estiloso da cidade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/4a16f59edda88c608e337e2f72079f1f.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/4a16f59edda88c608e337e2f72079f1f.webp?t=1754583361\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >O JOGO TAMB\u00c9M INCLUIR\u00c1:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 n\u00edveis diferentes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mais de 20 itens para criar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placar de l\u00edderes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... E mais!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/57414d7f1c65bc2e0ebb42b4ead8caa2.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/57414d7f1c65bc2e0ebb42b4ead8caa2.webp?t=1754583361\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/d3d8e51329954a8ad2e24102ea8d8f71.poster.avif?t=1754583361\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/d3d8e51329954a8ad2e24102ea8d8f71.webm?t=1754583361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973830/extras/d3d8e51329954a8ad2e24102ea8d8f71.mp4?t=1754583361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prison Boss Prohibition traz as artimanhas de cria\u00e7\u00e3o e simula\u00e7\u00e3o do Prison Boss VR para fora da pris\u00e3o e para as ruas!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bem-vindo \u00e0 cidade de New Yolk, um lugar maravilhoso para se viver, exceto pelo fato de o prefeito ter entrado em uma onda de proibi\u00e7\u00f5es. Administre uma cadeia de barracas que fabricam mercadorias legais e de legalidade question\u00e1vel, tudo em uma miss\u00e3o para conquistar o mercado negro e ganhar muita grana!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOGUE SOZINHO OU ARRANJE UM COMPARSA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voc\u00ea pode ser um ovo independente, jogar no modo cooperativo com um de seus amigos... ou recrutar um estranho totalmente confi\u00e1vel na internet.</p><p class=\